  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_open",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Welcome to Lamploom. I'm Ombel. I keep the lodge plans, spare pegs, and a number of invitations that do not require an answer.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not_flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "met_ombel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "ombel_meeting_question"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_question",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I am thinking about the places we leave open for guests. What makes a room feel welcoming to you?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "A place for something of my own.",
          "next": "ombel_meeting_value_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A clear invitation to rest.",
          "next": "ombel_meeting_value_2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Being allowed to come and go.",
          "next": "ombel_meeting_value_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_value_1",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Then we must leave some space unclaimed. A guest should not have to move our idea of them out of the way.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "ombel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_value_2",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "A chair, a little light, and permission to use both. I sometimes remember the chair and forget the permission.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "ombel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_value_3",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Yes. A warm window should help you find a door, not make you feel obliged to remain behind it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "ombel_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_meeting_close",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Find me in town when you feel like visiting. If I am measuring a wall, you may interrupt. The wall will keep its size.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_dawn_clear",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Clear dawn over Lamploom. I like seeing the windows before anyone decides what the day ought to contain.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_dawn_rain",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "A rainy morning. The felt awnings are doing their quiet work. I shall try to do mine as calmly.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_day_clear",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Good day. I have left a gap in the afternoon's plans. It seems a sensible place for a conversation.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_day_rain",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Come under the eaves. I was reviewing a plan for shelter, but actual shelter is more useful at the moment.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_dusk_clear",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Dusk has reached the oval windows. Each one makes the town look as if it has just remembered a guest.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_dusk_rain",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Evening rain. There is a dry place here where we can watch the lamplight on the steps.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_night_clear",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Lamploom is settling for the night. A few windows stay bright for those who prefer arriving after the bustle.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_greeting_night_rain",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The rain is quite busy tonight. You are welcome to be less so. There is room under this awning.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_offer",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "There is an unassigned window niche in town. Will you explore it with me and choose a welcoming arrangement for whoever comes?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Let's see what the niche could welcome.",
          "next": "ombel_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'll visit the window another time.",
          "next": "ombel_quest_defer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_accept",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Come into town when you are ready. We will begin by looking at the niche before deciding what belongs there.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_ombel_accepted",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "ombel_quest_travel_wait"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_defer",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Of course. A space left open should be allowed to stay open for a while.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_travel_wait",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Visit town when you like. The unassigned window niche will give us somewhere to begin.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_prepare",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Here in town, the niche still has no assigned purpose. Shall we explore it and choose an arrangement that invites company?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "town"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. Let's look before arranging it.",
          "next": "ombel_quest_prepared"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you have a particular guest in mind?",
          "next": "ombel_quest_detail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_detail",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "No. That is the useful part. We can make it warm and welcoming without deciding who will stand beside it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "town"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Yes. Let's look before arranging it.",
          "next": "ombel_quest_prepared"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_prepared",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Explore the unassigned window niche, then choose its welcoming arrangement with me. There is room to consider more than one idea.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "visited": "town"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_ombel_prepared",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_event_wait",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Explore the niche, choose its welcoming arrangement, and place it there. I am happy to look together whenever you are ready.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "e_ombel_window"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_ready",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "We explored the niche and chose an arrangement together. It welcomes a visitor without requiring a name on the plan.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "flag": "e_ombel_window"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Leave that welcome open to anyone.",
          "next": "ombel_quest_complete"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_complete",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Keep this little oval window model as a memento. I will use the real niche to remind myself that open space can be intentional.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_accepted"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_prepared"
        },
        {
          "flag": "e_ombel_window"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_ombel_done",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "give_item": "oval_window_model"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_after",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "I passed the niche this morning and nearly assigned it a purpose again. Then I let it continue being welcoming.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "ombel_quest_after_detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_quest_after_detail",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "It is a curious pleasure to leave a box on the lodge plan unlabeled. I may eventually stop checking it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_acquaintance",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I know how to welcome a guest in general. I would like to learn what welcome means to you in particular.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_ombel_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_friend",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "You helped me leave room for someone I could not predict. I would enjoy being your friend without making a plan for that either.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_ombel_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "friend_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "friend_ombel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "ombel_relationship_friend_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_friend_reply",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "There. No list of duties follows. I am pleased to discover that I do not need one.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_friend_repeat",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I set aside my plans when I saw you coming. A conversation can be the whole purpose of a visit.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_trusted",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "The gathering welcomed people beyond any list I could make. With you, I am learning to trust what a little open space can hold.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "friend_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "trusted_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "trusted_ombel",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "ombel_relationship_trusted_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_trusted_reply",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "Sometimes I arrange things because uncertainty makes me fidget. You can sit with me while I leave one thing undecided.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_relationship_trusted_repeat",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I have an unfinished plan and a free chair. Today I am more interested in who might use the chair.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "trusted_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_festival_before",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The old notice has left arrivals out of step. We need a shared plan that can welcome people from both directions.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_festival_ready_clear",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The rolling welcome is agreed. The ground display stays available; a flight view is optional when conditions are calm.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_festival_ready_rain",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The sheltered ground display is part of the shared plan. Rain changes where we gather, and everyone still has a place.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_festival_done"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_festival_after",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "festival",
      "text": "The welcome kept making room. No one had to prove they belonged by arriving with the first group.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_festival_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_idle_1",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "This peg is spare. I have labeled it spare, which may be more responsibility than a spare peg needs.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_idle_2",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "The Kindly Crown shades the town beautifully. It has never asked to see my seating plan.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_idle_3",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "idle",
      "text": "Brindle can turn one spare pad into an invitation. I sometimes turn one invitation into three pages of planning.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_m_agreement_offer",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "main",
      "text": "A single arrival time has made a very crowded little box. Shall we give this plan more room?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_weave_done"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'd like to help.",
          "next": "ombel_m_agreement_accept"
        },
        {
          "text": "Another time.",
          "next": "ombel_m_agreement_defer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_m_agreement_accept",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "main",
      "text": "Visit the town notice stand. Share the upstream notice and downstream reply together, with shelter for those who come early or late.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_weave_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "m_agreement_accepted",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_m_agreement_defer",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "main",
      "text": "There is no meeting you can miss. I'll keep a place beside the stand.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_weave_done"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_m_agreement_pending",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "main",
      "text": "At the town stand, share both notices. The welcome should offer a sheltered ground display and an optional calm-weather flight view.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_ombel"
        },
        {
          "flag": "m_agreement_accepted"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "m_agreement_done"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ombel_m_agreement_ready",
      "speaker": "ombel",
      "kind": "main",
